<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Discord</Major>
    <Description>this is a macro set to auto grind commands on discord.
it is default set to work on 9 discord accounts at the same time (one in the discord app eight in a search enginge.
just put the 9 discord tabs side by side in window mode then relocate the curser to the type section on both tabs
if you want it for different amounts just delete the other parts then you can run it.
change the /' command to whatever you want its set to a 30s delay between runs currently you can also change that.
screen resolution is set to 1920 x 1080p

Step 1) Load discord and set up your accounts
Step 2) Reposition Curser starting point to the type bar in your window
Step 3) replace /work with your command or leave it
Step 4) If you only want to run it on one discord account then delete the first half or replace with a second command
Step 5) change the delay at the end to whatever time the cooldown is on the discord bot
Step 6) Enjoy</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>2</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
